\underbrace{\frac{d[\mathrm{QX}]_o}{dt}}_{\text{rate of change of }[\mathrm{QX}]} = \underbrace{k_3[\mathrm{QA}]_o[\mathrm{BX}]}_{\text{rate produced in organic phase}} - \underbrace{k_LA([\mathrm{QX}]_o - [\mathrm{QX}]_{o,e})}_{\text{transport of }[\mathrm{QX}]\text{ to aq. layer}}
\xrightarrow{\times\varphi^2/(k_3Q_T^2)}\;\boxed{\frac{dW}{d\tau} = +P_2UV - \frac{k_La}{Q_Tk_3}(W - P_4Y)}
[d] Show 1 = V + W + X + Y. Mole balance on the catalyst (Q⁺); c_j = N_j/V; V_T = V_o + V_a:
V_a[\mathrm{QX}]_a + [\mathrm{QA}]_aV_a + [\mathrm{QA}]_oV_o + [\mathrm{QX}]_oV_o = Q_TV_T
\Rightarrow (1 - \varphi)\frac{[\mathrm{QX}]_a}{Q_T} + (1 - \varphi)\frac{[\mathrm{QA}]_a}{Q_T} + V + W = 1\;\therefore\;\boxed{Y + X + V + W = 1}
